  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {質問|しつもん}に{答|こた}える: to answer a question\n- {質問|しつもん}を{受|う}ける: to receive questions\n- {質問|しつもん}を{投|な}げかける: to pose a question\n\nUSAGE:\nThe noun {質問|しつもん} can be used with する to make a verb, or with particles like を and が.\n- {質問|しつもん}する: to ask a question (transitive action)\n- {質問|しつもん}がある: to have a question",
